.TH mdns-tui-browser 1 "2026-02-06" "mdns-tui-browser" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
mdns-tui-browser \- terminal-based mDNS service browser

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mdns-tui-browser
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
A terminal-based mDNS service browser built with Rust. It provides an interactive TUI interface for discovering and browsing mDNS services on the local network, with real-time updates, service filtering, and sorting capabilities.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display help message and exit.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Display version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-service-types \fISERVICE_TYPES\fR
Specify service types to browse for explicitly. If omitted, service types will be discovered automatically. Accepts comma-separated list or multiple instances of mDNS service types with intelligent auto-completion.

.SH SERVICE TYPES
The \fB\-\-service-types\fR argument supports various formats:
.RS
.IP \(bu
Simple names: \fBhttp\fR → \fB_http._tcp.local.\fR
.IP \(bu
Missing underscores: \fB_http\fR → \fB_http._tcp.local.\fR
.IP \(bu
Protocol specification: \fBhttp.tcp\fR → \fB_http._tcp.local.\fR
.IP \(bu
Subtype format: \fBprinter.sub.http\fR → \fBprinter._sub._http._tcp.local.\fR
.IP \(bu
Full forms: \fB_http._tcp.local.\fR, \fB_http._tcp\fR
.RE

.PP
Common service types:
.RS
.IP \(bu
\fBhttp\fR, \fBssh\fR, \fBprinter\fR, \fBairplay\fR, \fBraop\fR
.RE

.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.B Navigation
.br
↑/↓ or j/k             - Navigate services list
.br
←/→ or h/l             - Switch between service types
.br
PageUp/PageDown or b/f - Scroll services list by page
.br
Home/End               - Jump to first/last service
.TP
.B Sorting
.br
s                      - Cycle sort field forward
.br
S                      - Cycle sort field backward
.br
o                      - Toggle sort direction
.TP
.B Filtering
.br
/                      - Enter quick filter mode
.br
n                      - Clear current filter
.br
d                      - Remove offline services
.br
D                      - Clear stale service types
.TP
.B Other
.br
m                      - Show service metrics
.br
?                      - Toggle help popup
.br
Ctrl+j                 - Dump state to JSON file
.br
q or Ctrl+c            - Quit

.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.IP \(bu
Browse default services:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser
.IP \(bu
Browse with additional service types:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser \-\-service-types "_http._tcp.local.,_ssh._tcp.local."
.IP \(bu
Browse with shortened service types:
.br
.B mdns-tui-browser \-s "http,ssh"
.RE

